{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/829710-settlements-of-nunnehi","id":829710,"title":"Settlements of Nunnehi","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-14T07:19:05-08:00","id":829710,"title":"Settlements of Nunnehi","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> I would like to learn about &quot;Nunnehi&quot; settlements and their geographical provisions. I am not a USA citizen, so directions are kinda foreign to me. I am running a game for two years and now my party opened the first trod from &quot;Ludgate&quot; to &quot;San Francisco&quot;. I am planning the native population, but books &quot;Far West and South West&quot; terms kinda confussed me. Could you please help me on that? And also if there is someone who lives in San Francisco could he or she tell me about its old settlements of natives?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7562-kokorowatari","name":"KokoroWatari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T07:43:33-08:00","id":829720,"title":"","content":"The terms are somewhat nebulous, but you can consider the Far West to be the same as the American West in General, typically anything from about Texas or Colorado onward to the western coastline. The Southwest is specifically the lower half of that, including California but not anything as northern as Oregon, If you're going by associated First Nations locations, <a href=\"http://hockeygods.com/images/9049-First_Nations_Map_of_North_America\" target=\"_blank\">this map</a> might also be useful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T08:49:21-08:00","id":829753,"title":"","content":"If you are including California for Southwest, can I say San Francisco is in &quot;Southwest&quot;?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7562-kokorowatari","name":"KokoroWatari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"58"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-14T17:33:36-08:00","id":829931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KokoroWatari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/829710-settlements-of-nunnehi?p=829753#post829753\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If you are including California for Southwest, can I say San Francisco is in &quot;Southwest&quot;?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes. If you have specific Nunnehi kiths in mind and still feel uneasy, that map I linked might also help, since a fair number of their kiths do specify a given kith living among certain nations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}